---
import CategoryLayout from '../layouts/CategoryLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<CategoryLayout
  categoryId="text-qr"
  title={`Free Text & QR Tools – Word Counter, QR Codes | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description="Free word counter, character counter and QR code generator. No sign-up, no tracking of your text: everything runs in your browser."
  h1="Free Text & QR Code Tools"
>
  <h2>Count your words and share with a QR code</h2>
  <p>
    Essays, cover letters, product listings and social posts often come with a length limit.
    The <a href="/word-counter">Word Counter</a> counts words, sentences and paragraphs as you
    type and estimates reading time. The <a href="/character-counter">Character Counter</a>
    focuses on characters and shows how your text compares with common length limits.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <a href="/qr-code-generator">QR Code Generator</a> creates codes for a website link, a
    WiFi network, a phone number, an email, a WhatsApp chat, a contact card or a map location.
    These are static QR codes: the information is stored in the code itself, so they do not
    expire and do not depend on this site staying online.
  </p>
  <p>
    Text you type or paste is handled in your browser and is not sent anywhere. The tools work
    on phones and computers, with no app and no account needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before you print a QR code on a flyer, menu or business card, scan it with your own phone
    camera to make sure it opens the right link or joins the right network.
  </p>
</CategoryLayout>
